WEBVTT

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:19.990
Amiya.

00:01:56.790 --> 00:02:00.150
Inspector, they're still in the stronghold.

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:01.140
Are you sure?

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:05.070
Yes. There are no signs of anyone 
escaping to the surrounding areas.

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:06.680
That must be where the target is.

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:09.150
The sandstorm will let up soon.

00:02:09.150 --> 00:02:13.010
Keep scoping out the area with the drones, 
and have everyone get ready to move.

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:17.190
You come with me. We'll check with 
Rhodes Island on how to proceed.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:18.600
Understood.

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:22.200
Everyone, listen up!

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:27.710
They'll cling on to getting revenge 
even if it costs them their lives, huh?

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:31.250
I was scared.

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:36.010
I was scared of losing
 someone important to me again.

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:38.140
I...

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:43.290
I will protect you, no matter 
what it costs me, Doctor.

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:46.310
Even if it means I have to kill.

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:47.600
But...

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:52.310
Maybe there was another way.

00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:57.000
Maybe I didn't have to kill him.

00:02:57.850 --> 00:03:02.320
But I couldn't find it.

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:09.110
It fills me with remorse. I say I'm saving 
the Infected, but I end up taking their lives...

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:14.080
I didn't want to show you that side of me.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:20.120
I'm... so weak.

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:26.550
Amiya, I'm only here 
because you protected me.

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:30.980
Doctor...

00:03:31.550 --> 00:03:34.150
Thank you, Amiya.

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:41.150
It's because we promised each other.

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:45.160
Thank you, Doctor.

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:46.860
<i>Amiya.</i>

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:48.900
<i>We need you down here.</i>

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:51.210
I'll... be right there.

00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:55.210
You all be good boys and girls now, you hear?

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:58.850
Hello again, Officer Ch'en. How's it going?

00:03:58.850 --> 00:03:59.930
You...

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:05.340
Wow, scary. Sorry, though. 
I'm not here for you this time.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:06.220
W?!

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:08.580
I missed you, Amiya.

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:10.220
Mind coming over here?

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:14.650
Your buddy wants a little heart-to-heart.

00:04:15.970 --> 00:04:16.900
<i>Amiya...</i>

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:18.640
Misha?!

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:21.610
W!

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.400
See you next time.

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:24.240
Get down!

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:29.730
She's quick!

00:04:30.230 --> 00:04:31.820
Inspector, should we give chase?

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:33.460
No, it's useless.

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:36.300
Check if she planted 
any explosives in the area.

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:38.340
Take him to Medical.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.040
Right!

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:40.780
Can you stand?

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:41.380
Yeah...

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:43.360
Damn it. Amiya.

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:44.260
Yes...

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:47.760
<i>M-Misha! That is you, right?</i>

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:52.770
<i>Are you okay? We'll come 
rescue you right away! Wait there!</i>

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:57.790
<i>Hey, Amiya... Why?</i>

00:04:57.790 --> 00:04:58.460
Huh?

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:00.840
<i>Why did you kill him?</i>

00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:04.320
Misha?

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:09.760
<i>That was my baby brother.</i>

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:17.210
<i>You said Rhodes Island and 
Reunion chose different paths.</i>

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:24.840
<i>But Rhodes Island hurts and 
slaughters Reunion and the Infected, too.</i>

00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:27.150
<i>Isn't that right?</i>

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:30.010
<i>Misha—</i>

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:37.850
I've always turned a blind eye
to the Infected's sorrow and pain.

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:44.110
It was no different when they took 
my brother away after he got infected.

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:49.420
He kept calling my name in tears...

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:55.700
But I covered my ears and hid myself.

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:59.500
But now I get it.

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:02.350
Now that he's been taken from me again...

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:05.620
I finally get it.

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:10.430
My heart hurts so bad, I can't bear it!

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:18.770
Reunion wants everyone to know the pain
 that the Infected are forced to endure...

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:22.310
That's the punishment they deserve.

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:27.320
<i>As an Infected myself, 
I will stand with the Infected.</i>

00:06:27.890 --> 00:06:31.320
<i>It's high time I pay for my crimes.</i>

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:33.330
<i>Don't be hasty!</i>

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:37.200
<i>Just putting yourself in the shoes
 of the Infected won't change a thing!</i>

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:42.660
<i>We're Infected ourselves! 
We definitely understand how you feel.</i>

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:45.720
<i>Trust us! Rhodes Island will—</i>

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:46.710
Sorry, Amiya.

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:49.070
There's no other way.

00:06:50.190 --> 00:06:53.720
I'm not as strong as you are.

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:56.100
<i>Goodbye.</i>

00:06:57.820 --> 00:06:59.810
Misha. Misha!

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:01.330
Misha!

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:02.950
Amiya.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:07.810
Doctor...

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:10.650
She...

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:13.600
I... I...

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:16.490
What... should I do?

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:18.630
H-Hey! What's the big idea?

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:28.110
A leader should never show 
hesitation, no matter what.

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:30.510
On the battlefield, that's a fatal mistake.

00:07:30.980 --> 00:07:37.100
Misha has chosen to side with Reunion. 
Do you think you can still save her?

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:42.260
Hoshiguma, report.

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:46.330
Here. Situation normal inside the 
building and its surroundings.

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:47.900
We're ready to leave at any time.

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:48.780
Got it.

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:53.840
The L.G.D.'s objective is to get Misha.

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:57.780
For Lungmen's sake, we have to bring her back.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:01.790
That's the case for Rhodes Island, too, isn't it?

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:05.790
We leave in five minutes.

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:11.260
It's not like you to hesitate, little bunny.

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:15.550
Whatever your decision, we'll follow you.

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:18.000
Now that we've come this far,

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:21.070
we're gonna follow 
Rhodes Island till the very end!

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:22.480
Right, Texas?

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:24.190
That was your plan all along, huh?

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:26.170
Teehee, ya got me.

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:28.840
Everyone...

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:29.840
Amiya.

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:34.150
Amiya, what do you want to do?

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:38.860
I...

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:46.120
I want to talk to Misha.

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:48.360
If we talk to her, I'm sure...

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.340
I'm sure she'll understand!

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:56.400
Let's go see her.

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:57.220
Yes!

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:01.810
Didn't I say I wanted to be alone with him?

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:04.730
Drop the spooky voice already.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:06.940
You should know that I'm here for you.

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:11.470
It's a huge pain in the butt, 
but I have to protect you.

00:09:11.470 --> 00:09:13.480
Let's get out of here already.

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:16.570
And if I say I don't want to?

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:17.320
What?

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:22.840
You won't get anything out of me. 
I don't know anything.

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:26.330
But everybody treats me
 like I'm so important...

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:30.400
I'm absolutely sick of it!

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:32.460
My, oh my.

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:36.260
I guess everyone died for nothing, then.

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:40.760
We'll have even more dead bodies
 on our hands soon, too.

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:45.250
And then, the Reunion folks 
who fought for you will <i>all</i> be dead.

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:47.850
Kinda sad, don't you think?

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:51.110
So Skullshatterer died for nothing, huh?

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:51.900
Shut up!

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:56.900
Boy, you two are exactly alike.

00:09:58.190 --> 00:10:00.300
If you want to run, go without me.

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:06.220
I promised him we would go home together.

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:10.920
If I'm going home, I'm going 
with him and everyone else.

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:14.920
They're all... just like me...

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:17.320
We're all Infected.

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:21.930
We all need to be protected.
We have nowhere to go.

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:26.620
If he were here, he'd protect everyone.

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:28.940
I know he would!

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:31.940
He's not dead...

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:35.860
Skullshatterer can't die.

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:38.700
He's not going to die...

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:42.490
I'll make sure...

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:47.000
that Skullshatterer lives on.

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:58.430
<i>Got them!</i>

00:10:58.430 --> 00:11:00.720
<i>Surround them! On my mark, charge!</i>

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:03.020
<i>Lure them in! Move!</i>

00:11:04.590 --> 00:11:05.230
<i>Clear!</i>

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:06.880
<i>All clear here!</i>

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:10.980
Franka, 3 o'clock. Two men
 are hiding behind that boulder.

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:12.010
<i>Got it!</i>

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:15.190
<i>Clear over here, too.</i>

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:17.520
<i>That's their forward defensive line broken.</i>

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:19.140
<i>All squads, spread out!</i>

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:22.290
<i>Second wave, advance.
 Don't let any of them get away!</i>

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:24.490
Roger! Forward!

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:27.040
<i>Amiya, everything looks good over here.</i>

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.870
Understood. Proceed according to the plan.

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:31.120
<i>You got it!</i>

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.820
Let's go, Doctor.

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:33.560
Right.

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:35.860
I'll escort you. Please follow me.

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:36.880
Thank you.

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:46.870
Guess I didn't have to?

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:49.030
Nah, I owe you one.

00:11:49.030 --> 00:11:50.480
Don't mention it.

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:54.270
That said, Franka, is it okay to 
push this far into enemy lines?

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:55.770
Sure is.

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:57.770
Not happening!

00:12:00.310 --> 00:12:01.040
I see.

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:02.650
Franka, you're going too far ahead.

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:03.970
All right, let's go!

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:04.870
Sheesh.

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:08.800
<i>Clear!</i>

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:10.820
Inspector, all clear here.

00:12:10.820 --> 00:12:11.500
<i>Roger.</i>

00:12:11.950 --> 00:12:14.810
<i>All units, we've broken through 
their second defensive line.</i>

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:17.500
<i>Keep up this momentum. Forward!</i>

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:18.130
Roger.

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:22.320
We've taken out a lot of them, 
but there's still more near the stronghold.

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:23.510
Let's keep advancing.

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:27.510
Hoshiguma.

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:28.220
Yes?

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:32.960
Will you guarantee the lives of 
the remaining Reunion fighters?

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:36.230
We'll take responsibility and 
bring them back to Lungmen.

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:40.480
But the L.G.D. isn't like Rhodes Island.

00:12:41.270 --> 00:12:45.990
This is war. If they resist, 
we can't guarantee they will survive.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:57.250
Looks like the rumors about the 
Lungmen Special Inspection Unit are true.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:58.540
Eyes on the stronghold.

00:12:58.540 --> 00:12:59.290
Okay, but...

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:03.920
I was just thinking that Amiya's 
ideals might be hard to stick to.

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:06.890
All right. Let's focus on the job.

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:09.680
I can see you guys.

00:13:11.650 --> 00:13:13.520
Good work!

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:15.960
How was that? Totally cool, right?

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:16.830
Let's go.

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:19.150
Seriously? Can't spare a single compliment?

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:20.610
There's no time for that.

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:21.650
Sheesh.

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:30.870
<i>This is Exusiai. Do you read me?</i>

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:32.410
What's up?

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:34.490
<i>We don't see her anywhere.</i>

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:37.370
<i>Maybe W took her?</i>

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:38.500
Roger.

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:41.490
No sign of anyone in the area.

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:43.910
She should still be here... somewhere.

00:13:43.910 --> 00:13:45.600
<i>Okay, Doctor!</i>

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:47.090
<i>We'll look again.</i>

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:49.220
Got it. Thanks.

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:52.270
Doctor, let's change the mission objective.

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:53.100
Okay.

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:57.040
This is the Doctor. We haven't located Misha.

00:13:57.040 --> 00:13:59.270
Our objective now is to search—

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:08.110
It's...

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:09.990
It's a miracle...

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:20.800
A miracle has occurred.

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:24.710
Amiya, is that...

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:25.960
No...

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:30.470
That's not Skullshatterer...

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:35.560
Doctor!

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:37.350
Yeah.

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:40.900
Madame Ch'en, do you read me? It's Amiya.

00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:42.660
I have a request.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:48.210
Skullshatterer cleared a path for us!

00:14:48.210 --> 00:14:50.280
He's right behind us!

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:52.530
We're not done yet!

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:54.740
Let's show 'em what we got!

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:57.910
Skullshatterer!

00:14:58.980 --> 00:15:01.920
Thank heavens! You're still alive!

00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:06.920
I knew that couldn't have killed you! 
After all, you just reunited with Misha!

00:15:07.280 --> 00:15:09.860
She should've gotten out by now.

00:15:09.860 --> 00:15:13.930
Once we finish off the L.G.D., 
let's head back to Chernobog together!

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:17.590
What's this?

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:19.810
Flares?

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:22.920
Are you telling us to evacuate?

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:28.190
What are you talking about? 
You're here now! We can still fight—

00:15:30.020 --> 00:15:31.100
Skull...

00:15:33.920 --> 00:15:34.740
H-Hey!

00:15:35.070 --> 00:15:37.740
Wait, Skullshatterer!

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:41.750
Damn it! How's running away 
going to get us anywhere?

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:46.760
Get behind me!

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:49.180
It's different this time.

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:52.930
They want to finish us off
 and go home alive.

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:54.760
Get the injured behind the boulder!

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:58.780
Exusiai. There's no end to them. Let's fall back.

00:15:58.780 --> 00:15:59.890
Roger.

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:03.780
He shows up and the whole situation changes.

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:06.670
Seems he was a pretty popular guy.

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:08.400
Yeah.

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:26.500
Misha.

00:16:30.310 --> 00:16:33.750
You're Misha... right?

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:36.620
Why?

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.150
Misha.

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.020
What...

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:52.720
What I've done... is inexcusable.

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:59.160
But please... Please listen 
to me just one more time!

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:01.700
<i>Listen to you?</i>

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:04.370
<i>What's the point?</i>

00:17:07.780 --> 00:17:11.920
I'm sure fate intended 
for all of this to happen.

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:17.930
Amiya.

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:24.940
I'm sorry that... I never 
taught you how to make that doll.

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:26.810
<i>Amiya!</i>

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:29.520
Hurry. Neutralize Misha!

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:31.020
<i>Amiya!</i>

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:39.430
Finally...

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:48.090
It's all over.

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:55.660
M-Misha...

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:58.150
Misha...

00:17:58.370 --> 00:18:01.640
I told you before: don't hesitate!

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:06.780
A moment of indecisiveness 
can turn the tide of a battle!

00:18:06.780 --> 00:18:10.770
Do you still not understand the weight 
of the responsibility you carry?!

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:18.380
This is the ending that we all face.

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:25.130
<i>Inspector, the enemy is surrendering.</i>

00:18:25.130 --> 00:18:26.430
I see.

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:29.960
We've found the target. 
Signal the collection team.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:30.580
<i>Yes, ma'am.</i>

00:18:41.340 --> 00:18:48.100
It looks like our fates intertwined.

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:54.120
They cross and clash with each other...

00:18:55.020 --> 00:19:02.030
Even the best chess players find themselves 
in checkmate at the most unexpected moments.

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:07.660
And that's why, all's well, in the end.

00:19:24.570 --> 00:19:27.680
Amiya, are you taking that as a keepsake?

00:19:29.340 --> 00:19:34.190
So be it. Just know that your room will 
one day be filled with masks like this one.

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:38.690
Just mourning the dead isn't 
going to change the world.

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:45.200
When we have to, the L.G.D. and I 
draw our swords without hesitation.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:49.200
But that's not the Rhodes Island way, is it?

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:53.000
Welcoming the Infected with 
open arms and saving them...

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:55.210
That's not something we can do.

00:19:57.280 --> 00:19:59.210
Little leader of Rhodes Island.

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:04.220
You are nobody else but yourself. You just 
have to walk the path you have chosen.

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:07.760
The path that belongs only to you.

00:20:09.690 --> 00:20:11.980
My path...

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:51.240
I always thought Rhodes 
Island could help everyone.

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:56.250
But in the end, I couldn't do anything.

00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:02.250
Madame Ch'en told me to walk 
the path that I have chosen...

00:22:03.590 --> 00:22:08.260
I... I want to break these chains of hatred.

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:12.070
But if this is what awaits us
 at the end of that path...

00:22:13.840 --> 00:22:17.020
Will everyone still believe in me?

00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:23.290
"We just have to follow this path. Everything 
will work out." No one's going to believe—

00:22:23.290 --> 00:22:24.530
Amiya.

00:22:25.710 --> 00:22:31.030
When I woke up, 
I saw your light in the darkness.

00:22:32.320 --> 00:22:35.270
I found the path that I must walk.

00:22:36.400 --> 00:22:40.740
It wasn't for anyone else to decide whether 
I should follow the path you showed me.

00:22:41.320 --> 00:22:44.800
I chose for myself to walk this path.

00:22:46.690 --> 00:22:51.800
You're always ahead of the others, 
lighting the way for the rest of us.

00:22:52.640 --> 00:22:57.750
I will keep walking my path
 in the same direction as you.

00:23:02.840 --> 00:23:04.190
Doctor.

00:23:05.790 --> 00:23:07.390
Thank you.

00:23:08.690 --> 00:23:11.160
Let's go.

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:12.040
Right.
